    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle of Nowhere</strong> throws you into a relentless VR battlefield where every second counts. Armed with upgradeable weapons and lightning-fast reflexes, you must survive wave after wave of undead chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your average shooter\u2014this is an <strong>adrenaline-pumping, zombie-blasting, VR arcade experience</strong> designed for players who crave intensity and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/e71c24d2ff24704b2483b243a3fb8714.poster.avif?t=1746804098\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/e71c24d2ff24704b2483b243a3fb8714.webm?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/e71c24d2ff24704b2483b243a3fb8714.mp4?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced VR Combat</strong>: Dodge, shoot, and slash in heart-racing close-quarters encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Weapon Upgrades</strong>: Enhance your guns, knives, and explosives to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemy Waves</strong>: Face off against swarms of enemies with evolving attack patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fights That Push You to the Limit</strong>: Every few waves, a monstrous boss will test your skill, timing, and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability with Leaderboards</strong>: Climb the ranks and prove your worth in global scoreboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/88b0c62f69aa19849a856929ba089691.poster.avif?t=1746804098\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/88b0c62f69aa19849a856929ba089691.webm?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/88b0c62f69aa19849a856929ba089691.mp4?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're slicing through enemies with a souped-up combat knife or detonating barrels for explosive multikills, <i>Battle of Nowhere</i> delivers nonstop thrills built from the ground up for VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/df04b074093fc602e9ed4c9376d66ee2.poster.avif?t=1746804098\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/df04b074093fc602e9ed4c9376d66ee2.webm?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/df04b074093fc602e9ed4c9376d66ee2.mp4?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s <strong>you vs. the apocalypse</strong>\u2014are you fast enough to survive?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle of Nowhere</strong> throws you into a relentless VR battlefield where every second counts. Armed with upgradeable weapons and lightning-fast reflexes, you must survive wave after wave of undead chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your average shooter\u2014this is an <strong>adrenaline-pumping, zombie-blasting, VR arcade experience</strong> designed for players who crave intensity and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/e71c24d2ff24704b2483b243a3fb8714.poster.avif?t=1746804098\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/e71c24d2ff24704b2483b243a3fb8714.webm?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/e71c24d2ff24704b2483b243a3fb8714.mp4?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced VR Combat</strong>: Dodge, shoot, and slash in heart-racing close-quarters encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Weapon Upgrades</strong>: Enhance your guns, knives, and explosives to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemy Waves</strong>: Face off against swarms of enemies with evolving attack patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fights That Push You to the Limit</strong>: Every few waves, a monstrous boss will test your skill, timing, and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability with Leaderboards</strong>: Climb the ranks and prove your worth in global scoreboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/88b0c62f69aa19849a856929ba089691.poster.avif?t=1746804098\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/88b0c62f69aa19849a856929ba089691.webm?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/88b0c62f69aa19849a856929ba089691.mp4?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're slicing through enemies with a souped-up combat knife or detonating barrels for explosive multikills, <i>Battle of Nowhere</i> delivers nonstop thrills built from the ground up for VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/df04b074093fc602e9ed4c9376d66ee2.poster.avif?t=1746804098\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/df04b074093fc602e9ed4c9376d66ee2.webm?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683090/extras/df04b074093fc602e9ed4c9376d66ee2.mp4?t=1746804098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s <strong>you vs. the apocalypse</strong>\u2014are you fast enough to survive?</p>",
